* Added a new route `/routing/hybrid` to the application router, handled by the new `hybrid_routing_evaluate` function. [[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0b979b6de560b29c1d97336878db56179224aa21d96fe099630c6628479ed020R228-R231) [[2]](diffhunk://#diff-2f935612004a95b0b20ea32f896554a8d594d2fd9faa19319e37470a9ff34689R1)
