## Bug 1: Mage intro video (`game.js`, `index.html`)

- **Wrong path**: `'mage.mp4'` → `'Mage.mp4'` (matches actual filename in repo root)
- **Silent autoplay failure**: browsers block autoplay on unmuted video — added `muted` attribute to `<video id="mage-intro-video">`
