video.load();
video.play().catch(err => console.warn('Autoplay blocked:', err));
```

## Bug 2: Skill tree reroll cooldown stuck (`ui.js`)

`rerollOnCooldown` was set to `true` but only reset inside `setTimeout`/inline calls to `showSkillTree()`. Any throw from `showSkillTree()` left the flag permanently `true`.

- Wrapped both reset paths in `try/catch` to guarantee `rerollOnCooldown = false` regardless of render errors
- Added safety reset at the top of `showSkillTree()` to clear any stale cooldown state on navigation

```js
setTimeout(() => {
    try {
        rerollOnCooldown = false;
        showSkillTree();
        // restore scroll positions...
    } catch(e) {
        rerollOnCooldown = false;
        console.error('Error re-rendering skill tree after reroll:', e);
    }
}, 500);
```

